# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pythaflow — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to:  .env.local
# 2. Fill in your actual values below
# 3. NEVER commit .env.local to GitHub — it's in .gitignore
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Anthropic API Key
# Get it from: https://console.anthropic.com → API Keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# OpenRouter API Key for AI generation
OPENROUTER_API_KEY="sk-or-v1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"

# Gmail SMTP Configuration for sending emails (2FA, replies, etc.)
# 1. Go to your Google Account -> Security
# 2. Enable 2-Step Verification
# 3. Create an "App Password" (search for it in Security)
# 4. Paste the 16-character App Password below without spaces
SMTP_EMAIL="your_gmail@gmail.com"
SMTP_PASSWORD="your_16_char_app_password"

# Your Calendly booking URL (shown on assessment results CTA)
NEXT_PUBLIC_CALENDLY_URL=https://calendly.com/YOUR_USERNAME/30min

# Your contact email (shown on contact page)
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL=hello@pythaflow.com

# Production domain (used for CORS in API route)
# During dev leave as-is. On production set to: https://pythaflow.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"


By default, the admin email is nsl.kawsar@gmail.com and the password is admin123
(unless you have overridden them with
 ADMIN_EMAIL and ADMIN_PASSWORD in your .env.local file).
